# Credentials and switches for the scheduled pull.
#
# Install to /opt/gtg/pull-secrets.env with mode 600. It is read by
# deploy/pull-all.sh and by nothing else; it is not passed to the container, so
# these never appear in `docker inspect` or in the image.
#
# NOT a file to commit. The real one lives only on the VM.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the switch
# Nothing runs until this is 1. The timer may be enabled; this is what decides
# whether the timer's run does any work.
GTG_PULL_ENABLED=0

# ------------------------------------------------------------ the gate that
#                                                              matters most
# Mango allows one session per account. A pull every morning as a person would
# sign that person out of Mango daily, and their session would sign the pull out
# in turn — intermittently, and with nothing on either side saying why.
#
# Set to yes only when MANGO_USER below is a service account of its own, not an
# employee's login. Nothing can check this but you.
MANGO_IS_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=no

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ where to
GTG_DATA_DIR=/data

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Mango RE
MANGO_BASE_URL=https://chaithanin.mangoanywhere.com/production.re
MANGO_USER=<the service account>
MANGO_PASS=<its password>
MANGO_MAINCODE=MG1

# Which receipt kinds are payments of the contract price — an accounting
# decision, and until it is answered the pull reports that its totals do not
# add up. Add --payment-kinds B,C,D,T (or whichever) and --company <code> to
# write rather than look.
MANGO_PULL_ARGS=--dry-run

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- Booking
# One key for this system only, so it can be revoked on its own.
BOOKING_API_KEY=<bk_live_...>
BOOKING_PULL_ARGS=--dry-run

# ----------------------------------------------------------- Mango Anywhere
# Needs a browser, which wants about 600 MB. Leave unset on a small machine and
# the pull is skipped with a reason rather than killed for memory.
#
# --flip-bank-sign only once the sign has been confirmed against one account in
# Mango's own screen: a cash position with the sign wrong is worse than none.
# ANYWHERE_PULL_ARGS=--all-companies --map MG1=CHTN,MG2=HAMONIA --flip-bank-sign
